-- the fields of a stat buffer the guard compares against the index: the size at byte 48 and the
-- modification time at byte 88, each named with the proof that its Int64 cell fits inside the 256 bytes
-- of the buffer, so neither read can be outside it (2026-11-18)
os-size-time : Word → RM 256 (Word × Word)
os-size-time r = λ b → (b , (i64toWord (load64 256 b 48 (200 , λ i → 256)) , i64toWord (load64 256 b 88 (160 , λ i → 256))))
